CLI flag for queue

Allow manually specifying the queue that CLI commands interact with when relevant. This
includes, but is not limited to the push, pop, swap, tor, rot, append, export, import,
inbox, and assign commands. Because this is *very* common, it should be done with
resusable components to the best extent possible. Any refactoring necessary to
accomplish this efficiently (in terms of lines of code) is in-scope. If that's too large
for a single task, create intermediate subtasks (whose parent property is a link to this
task) to be worked on as part of this.